{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34465","headline":"和袭美重送圆载上人归日本国 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美重送圆载上人归日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老思东极旧岩扉，却待秋风泛舶归。\n晓梵阳乌当石磬，夜禅阴火照田衣。\n见翻经论多盈箧，亲植杉松大几围。\n遥想到时思魏阙，只应遥拜望斜晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}